---
// v2/src/components/morrow/Clubhouse.astro
---
<section aria-labelledby="clubhouse-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-bone text-charcoal" id="clubhouse"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-8"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">04</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Clubhouse &amp; architecture</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.3rem,4.4vw,4.4rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="clubhouse-heading">Built from the ground <em class="font-serif font-normal">it stands on.</em></h2><p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75" data-reveal="true">The clubhouse is set into the slope above the 18th green, its walls pressed from the estate's own earth and its roof drawn as one long timber line. From the fairway it almost disappears. From the terrace you can see the whole course.</p><ol class="mt-12 border-t border-charcoal/15"><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5" data-reveal="true"><span class="pt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">01</span><div><h3 class="type-wide text-[15px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">Rammed earth</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Walls pressed by hand from soil excavated on site, a building method native to the Alentejo for a thousand years.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5" data-reveal="true"><span class="pt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">02</span><div><h3 class="type-wide text-[15px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">Timber canopy</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">A 64-metre roof of cross-laminated larch, cantilevered over the terrace without a single column.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5" data-reveal="true"><span class="pt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">03</span><div><h3 class="type-wide text-[15px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">Frameless glass</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">The pavilion opens fully onto the 18th green, so the course becomes the fourth wall.</p></div></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[3rem_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5" data-reveal="true"><span class="pt-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/50">04</span><div><h3 class="type-wide text-[15px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em]">Passive climate</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Thermal mass, cross-ventilation and a solar canopy replace air conditioning entirely.</p></div></li></ol><div class="mt-10" data-reveal="true"><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" href="/morrow/clubhouse"><span class="relative py-1">Inside the clubhouse<span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-left bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-x-0 group-hover:origin-right"></span></span><span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-current/30 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:border-current"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-7"><figure><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-t-full bg-sand sm:aspect-[5/6] lg:aspect-[4/5]" data-arch="true"><div class="absolute inset-0" data-arch-image="true"><img alt="The modern clubhouse with its long flat roof and glowing glass, a row of carts and an olive tree in front" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/clubhouse-carts.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:30% center;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/60 to-transparent"></div><p class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 flex justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone sm:bottom-7 sm:left-7 sm:right-7 sm:text-[11px]"><span>The clubhouse</span><span>Above the 18th green</span></p></div></figure></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 lg:mt-28 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-end"><figure class="lg:col-span-8"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[16/10] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="left"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="The clubhouse terrace on the cliff edge, with coastal fairways stretching along the sea below" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 66vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/cliff-terrace.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:30% center;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 flex justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground"><span>The terrace on the cliff above the coast holes</span><span class="hidden sm:inline">1,850 m² under one roof</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px] lg:aspect-[3/4]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="6"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A golfer walking past the cart court toward the lit clubhouse terrace at sunset" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/clubhouse-arrival.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:36% center;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><figcaption class="mt-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">Arriving for a twilight round</figcaption></figure></div><dl class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-10 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">timber canopy without columns</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="64" data-decimals="0">64</span> m</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">of clubhouse under one roof</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="1850" data-decimals="0">1,850</span> m²</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">of daytime power from the solar canopy</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="100" data-decimals="0">100</span>%</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">air conditioning units, by design</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="0" data-decimals="0">0</span></span></dd></div></dl></div></section>
